OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 885,000 trees planted,  
OL,4,Acouncil hears                          
OL,6,FMore than 885,000 trees have been      
OL,7,Fplanted in Surrey in the last seven    
OL,8,Fyears, a council meeting has heard.    
OL,10,FSurrey County Council introduced a     
OL,11,Ftarget in 2019 to plant 1.2 million new
OL,12,Ftrees by 2030, representing one for    
OL,13,Fevery resident.                        
OL,15,FThe total includes trees planted by the
OL,16,Fcouncil, schools, businesses, charities
OL,17,Fand community groups, as well as       
OL,18,Fwoodland and hedgerow schemes.         
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
