OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 885,000 trees planted,  
OL,4,Acouncil hears                          
OL,6,FMarisa Heath, the council's cabinet    
OL,7,Fmember for environment and planning,   
OL,8,Ftold a cabinet meeting on Tuesday that 
OL,9,Fthe achievement was "tremendous".      
